WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.767
Want beautiful brows every morning without drawing them on? There are three popular options!

2
00:00:05.767 --> 00:00:10.502
Brow lamination, brow tint and permanent make-up: let's compare.

3
00:00:10.502 --> 00:00:15.540
Brow lamination shapes the brow hairs and sets them neatly in one direction.

4
00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:20.884
Brows look fuller and natural, and the result lasts about six to eight weeks.

5
00:00:20.884 --> 00:00:25.863
A brow tint adds colour to every hair, especially on light blonde brows.

6
00:00:25.863 --> 00:00:31.352
Brows look more defined and darker, and the colour lasts about three to four weeks.

7
00:00:31.352 --> 00:00:37.026
With permanent make-up, pigment goes into the upper layer of the skin, and the brow shape stays.

8
00:00:37.026 --> 00:00:42.815
It lasts one to three years. Choose a certified artist and do an allergy test first.

9
00:00:42.815 --> 00:00:51.129
In short: unruly brows, go for lamination; light brows, a tint; and for long-lasting results, permanent make-up.

10
00:00:51.129 --> 00:00:54.424
Not sure what suits your brows? Ask Moja Beauty!

11
00:00:54.424 --> 00:01:00.759
